# D3-BD-001: Known boundary: salt sensitivity is absent from the simple swelling model
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 instant_snow_powder 0.2g
add v1 water 30g
add v2 instant_snow_powder 0.2g
add v2 water 30g
add v2 NaCl 1g
look v1
look v2
measure v1 conductivity
measure v2 conductivity
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
